# Spherical fusion-category formalization boundary

The former contents of this module used `True` fields and theorems to stand in
for semisimplicity, duals, the pentagon, pivotality, sphericality, and
topological ground-state degeneracy. Those placeholders did not define or
prove a fusion category and have been removed.

The repository's concrete Fibonacci fusion multiplicities and finite
`F`/`R`/`B` matrix readouts are owned by
`InfoGeometry.Categorical.FibonacciFusionCategoryData`. That owner explicitly
does not claim a `BraidedCategory` instance or spherical structure. Such a
structure remains open until its category, tensor product, associator,
braiding, and coherence proofs are constructed.
